Subject: [PATCH] security: fix web dependency and CycloneDX hash encoding

Update source-map-js to 1.2.2 for the indexed source map denial-of-service
fix, and decode npm SRI values to validated hexadecimal CycloneDX hashes.
Include focused regression tests for the source checkout shipped by the
development image.

CVE: CVE-2026-93749
Upstream-Status: Pending [firmware repository security updates]

